{"id":"5096907e2ea79ebf","group":"93","path":"93/93-ax-substitution.md","title":"Substitution","display":"ax-substitution — Substitution","type":"axiom","metadata":{"type":"axiom","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-ax-substitution","aliases":["93-ax-substitution"],"display":"ax-substitution — Substitution","depends_on":["[[93-df-logic]]","[[93-df-language]]","[[93-df-variable]]","[[93-df-substitution]]","[[93-df-consequence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"axiom"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-ax-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-ax-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ax-substitution — Substitution"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bd7e4207897c8db3\" href=\"?note=bd7e4207897c8db3\" title=\"93-df-logic\">93-df-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a33dcee0f62c9026\" href=\"?note=a33dcee0f62c9026\" title=\"93-df-language\">93-df-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"11b62d0ad578fa42\" href=\"?note=11b62d0ad578fa42\" title=\"93-df-variable\">93-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8e602c19b2984096\" href=\"?note=8e602c19b2984096\" title=\"93-df-substitution\">93-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"afd7605d365be7b6\" href=\"?note=afd7605d365be7b6\" title=\"93-df-consequence\">93-df-consequence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=T_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\">\\(F=T_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf L=\\langle F,\\vdash\\rangle\">\\(\\mathsf L=\\langle F,\\vdash\\rangle\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}(F,\\vdash)\">\\(\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}(F,\\vdash)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq F\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in F\">\\(\\varphi\\in F\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}(\\sigma;\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}(\\sigma;\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\)</span> as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8e602c19b2984096\" href=\"?note=8e602c19b2984096\" title=\"93-df-substitution\">93-df-substitution</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma^{\\tau}\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma^{\\tau}\\)</span> is the homomorphic extension of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> to formulas.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}(F,\\vdash)\\to\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\\forall\\sigma\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}(\\sigma;\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\land\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\n\\to\\widehat\\sigma^{\\tau}[\\Gamma]\\vdash\\widehat\\sigma^{\\tau}(\\varphi)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}(F,\\vdash)\\to\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\\forall\\sigma\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}(\\sigma;\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\land\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\n\\to\\widehat\\sigma^{\\tau}[\\Gamma]\\vdash\\widehat\\sigma^{\\tau}(\\varphi)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Structurality requires uniform substitution of both the conclusion and every premise. The indexed logic premise guarantees that the same <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> controls both the formula algebra and the substitution extension.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bd7e4207897c8db3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"a33dcee0f62c9026","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"11b62d0ad578fa42","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"8e602c19b2984096","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"afd7605d365be7b6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-consequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"8e602c19b2984096","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma\\subseteq F$, $\\varphi\\in F$, and $\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}(\\sigma;\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93})$ as in [[93-df-substitution]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"F=T_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf L=\\langle F,\\vdash\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}(F,\\vdash)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq F","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\i